WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,810
Since you are so arrogant

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:04,010
Can you make it to Tao Langdong tomorrow morning?

3
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:07,010
The east is the direction where the sun rises in the morning

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:09,010
Just you

5
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,610
I haven’t eaten Tanglang for a long time.

6
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:12,810
You will wash your long neck tomorrow

7
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:15,010
Just wait for my winged knife to crush you to pieces

8
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:16,750
Don't break the appointment

9
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:20,190
My meat is delicious boss

10
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:22,740
The Qing court became so proud

11
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:25,340
Do you think I can't beat him?

12
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,340
The wings of the Qing court are sharper than swords

13
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,740
I'm afraid we'll become scumbags

14
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:32,360
Can't handle him

15
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,410
Boss, get out of the way

16
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:50,860
Don't get trampled to death by this big guy

17
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:52,520
You don't want to live anymore

18
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,120
Actually I want to wear you
